# Reasons that mainthread::AllowBlocking scopes in src/ and platforms/ may
# name, checked by source-checks.cmake. Each scope lets the main thread wait
# where no input can arrive before the wait ends. A new reason is a decision
# for the user: name it in doc/validation.md#main-thread-guard as well, or
# remove the wait. Remove a line when its last scope goes.
annotation read
application quits
closing reader
final native progress before storage handoff
host checkpoint
kosync account settings
library opening
library progress
library save
native progress
opening status before reader input
remembered layout before reader input
scenario wifi step
settings write
sleep
wifi-off at sleep
wifi-off before reader input
wifi-off while closing
